    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/a94780839a6f32f81fab3b11577fa0b9.poster.avif?t=1710362905\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/a94780839a6f32f81fab3b11577fa0b9.webm?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/a94780839a6f32f81fab3b11577fa0b9.mp4?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>One fateful evening, your world was thrust into chaos. A series of unfortunate events unfolded, leading you here\u2026<br><br><strong>PLAYTOPIA WAREHOUSE</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/fbd82bc74782122ae258e9f87b0d8b01.poster.avif?t=1710362905\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/fbd82bc74782122ae258e9f87b0d8b01.webm?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/fbd82bc74782122ae258e9f87b0d8b01.mp4?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You find yourself in a graveyard of forgotten theater sets and props. What was once a familiar place is now shrouded in the darkness of the night, emanating an eerie sense of unfamiliarity. It has been a while since anyone set foot in this place. Yet, now it\u2019s your only shot at saving your family and unraveling the truth.<br><br><strong>NOT THE WAY IT USED TO BE\u2026</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/1f2cc4bb89e9a66a71f8c43ca3c5dbf4.poster.avif?t=1710362905\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/1f2cc4bb89e9a66a71f8c43ca3c5dbf4.webm?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/1f2cc4bb89e9a66a71f8c43ca3c5dbf4.mp4?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This warehouse doesn\u2019t seem to add up to your memories. A sense of someone walking in the hallways envelops you with each passing moment. The anticipation of the unknown looms around every corner.<br><br><strong>HIDE AND SEEK IN THE SHADOWS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/8912f7ef9dc544ebce8c2f8846b8ec47.poster.avif?t=1710362905\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/8912f7ef9dc544ebce8c2f8846b8ec47.webm?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/8912f7ef9dc544ebce8c2f8846b8ec47.mp4?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You loved this game in your childhood! Now it doesn\u2019t seem to be as fun\u2026<br><br><strong>ESCAPE?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/d435de8f1744169551ab7c1ed6678d25.poster.avif?t=1710362905\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/d435de8f1744169551ab7c1ed6678d25.webm?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/d435de8f1744169551ab7c1ed6678d25.mp4?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Or stick around and reveal more of your secrets?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/a94780839a6f32f81fab3b11577fa0b9.poster.avif?t=1710362905\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/a94780839a6f32f81fab3b11577fa0b9.webm?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/a94780839a6f32f81fab3b11577fa0b9.mp4?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>One fateful evening, your world was thrust into chaos. A series of unfortunate events unfolded, leading you here\u2026<br><br><strong>PLAYTOPIA WAREHOUSE</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/fbd82bc74782122ae258e9f87b0d8b01.poster.avif?t=1710362905\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/fbd82bc74782122ae258e9f87b0d8b01.webm?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/fbd82bc74782122ae258e9f87b0d8b01.mp4?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You find yourself in a graveyard of forgotten theater sets and props. What was once a familiar place is now shrouded in the darkness of the night, emanating an eerie sense of unfamiliarity. It has been a while since anyone set foot in this place. Yet, now it\u2019s your only shot at saving your family and unraveling the truth.<br><br><strong>NOT THE WAY IT USED TO BE\u2026</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/1f2cc4bb89e9a66a71f8c43ca3c5dbf4.poster.avif?t=1710362905\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/1f2cc4bb89e9a66a71f8c43ca3c5dbf4.webm?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/1f2cc4bb89e9a66a71f8c43ca3c5dbf4.mp4?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This warehouse doesn\u2019t seem to add up to your memories. A sense of someone walking in the hallways envelops you with each passing moment. The anticipation of the unknown looms around every corner.<br><br><strong>HIDE AND SEEK IN THE SHADOWS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/8912f7ef9dc544ebce8c2f8846b8ec47.poster.avif?t=1710362905\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/8912f7ef9dc544ebce8c2f8846b8ec47.webm?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/8912f7ef9dc544ebce8c2f8846b8ec47.mp4?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You loved this game in your childhood! Now it doesn\u2019t seem to be as fun\u2026<br><br><strong>ESCAPE?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/d435de8f1744169551ab7c1ed6678d25.poster.avif?t=1710362905\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/d435de8f1744169551ab7c1ed6678d25.webm?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/d435de8f1744169551ab7c1ed6678d25.mp4?t=1710362905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Or stick around and reveal more of your secrets?",
